        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 222304, 1-3/4 x 4 Modern Rectangular Knurled Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 4 Inch Knurled Flush Pull features a unique knurled designed meant to match perfectly with all of Emtek Knurled Door Hardware. This modern flush pull is one of the first with the knurled design, so you can be on the leading edge of contemporary home decor. The 1-3/4 x 4 Modern Rectangular Knurled Flush Pull is for use on sliding doors like pocket doors. Choose from your favorite modern finish color options.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/7-inch-knurled-flush-pull-emtek-222307\"><b>7\" Flush Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek 222304 Pocket Door Flush Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Cut-Out Height: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Cut-Out Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish brad nails.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-222304-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262438\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek 222304 Dimensions  Diagram (PDF)</a></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
